    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70601" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέωτα</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>next year,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
